OL,3,ACass report author tells BBC draft
OL,4,Aconversion practices bill is not
OL,5,Aworkable
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe author of the independent review
OL,8,Finto gender identity services for young
OL,9,Fpeople says she does not support the
OL,10,Fcurrent draft bill banning conversion
OL,11,Fpractices - having previously welcomed
OL,12,Fit.
OL,14,FBaroness Cass told BBC Radio 4's Today
OL,15,Fprogramme while it is "desirable" to
OL,16,Fban the practices, "the challenge is
OL,17,Fthat we have not yet as far as I can
OL,18,Fsee got a workable bill".
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
