OL,3,ACass report author tells BBC draft
OL,4,Aconversion practices bill is not
OL,5,Aworkable
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt a parliamentary committee
OL,8,Fscrutinising the bill, she also said it
OL,9,Frisked "serious unintended
OL,10,Fconsequences" for parents of children
OL,11,Fsuffering gender distress, or medical
OL,12,Fprofessionals working in that area.
OL,14,FA government spokesperson said they
OL,15,Fwelcomed her comments.
